        "## Technical Stack\n",
        "\n",
        "The project uses the following technologies:\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Web Scraping**: Scrapy Framework, Selenium, DDG_search, Google API\n",
        "- **Data Processing**: Python, Pandas, SQLite\n",
        "- **Machine Learning**: Scikit-learn, Surprise, Resnet\n",
        "- **Visualization**: Matplotlib, Plotly\n",
